The colour and graphics packages have been updated. They should by now
have reached all ctan sites, (I checked ftp.tex.ac.uk and and
ftp.dante.de).

ctan:macros/latex2e/packages/graphics

The documentation is still a bit terse:-) but some bugs have been
fixed, and the new code has better error handling, and (I hope) a
better handling of `smart' drivers like dvips which can create files
`on the fly'.

There is a ChangeLog file in the release which details the main
changes.

If you have any problems/comments about these files, please send them
to me and Sebastian (carlisle@cs.man.ac.uk,spqr@ftp.tex.ac.uk) rather
than the usual latex-bugs address.

David

